  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>α</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>β</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>β</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>α</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Now, taking value from the option we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo> </mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>, so for other value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi></math> is not a integer.</p>",
